{"title":"Regular Expression Matching Variant","difficulty":"Hard","statement":"You are given a text `s` and a pattern `p`. Decide whether the pattern matches the **entire** text.\n\nThe pattern is made of lowercase letters, `.` and `*`, and supports two special symbols:\n\n- `.` matches any single character.\n- `*` matches **zero or more** copies of the element right before it (that element is a lowercase letter or `.`). For example `a*` matches `\"\"`, `a`, `aa`, ...; and `.*` matches any string, including the empty one.\n\nThe match must cover all of `s`, not just a part of it. The pattern is always well formed: `*` is never the first character of `p`, and it always follows a letter or a `.` (never another `*`).\n\nPrint `true` if the whole text is matched by the pattern, otherwise `false`.\n\n**Follow-up:** the interviewer asked how the solution would change \"at scale\", for example when the same pattern must be tested against millions of texts, or when texts and patterns are too long to compare in quadratic time. Discuss it; the tests only check the single-pair problem.","inputFormat":"The first line contains the text `s`.\nThe second line contains the pattern `p`.","outputFormat":"Print `true` or `false`.","constraints":["1 ≤ |s| ≤ 1000","1 ≤ |p| ≤ 1000","s consists of lowercase English letters","p consists of lowercase English letters, `.` and `*`, and is well formed as described above"],"examples":[{"input":"mississippi\nmis*is*ip*.","output":"true","explanation":"Read the pattern as `m`, `i`, `s*`, `i`, `s*`, `i`, `p*`, `.`. They match \"m\", \"i\", \"ss\", \"i\", \"ss\", \"i\", \"pp\" and \"i\", which uses up the whole text."},{"input":"aab\nc*a*b","output":"true","explanation":"`c*` matches zero characters, `a*` matches \"aa\" and `b` matches \"b\", so the whole text is matched."},{"input":"abcd\n.*c","output":"false","explanation":"`.*` can take \"ab\" and `c` takes \"c\", but then \"d\" is left over. The pattern must cover the entire text, and `.*` followed by `c` forces the text to end in `c`, so the answer is false."}],"tests":[{"input":"a\na","output":"true"},{"input":"a\nb","output":"false"},{"input":"a\na*","output":"true"},{"input":"a\n.","output":"true"},{"input":"ab\n.*","output":"true"},{"input":"mississippi\nmis*is*p*.","output":"false"},{"input":"aaa\nab*a*c*a","output":"true"},{"input":"abc\n.*c","output":"true"},{"input":"ab\n.*c","output":"false"},{"input":"b\na*","output":"false"},{"input":"a\nab*","output":"true"},{"input":"aa\na","output":"false"},{"input":"abcd\nd*","output":"false"},{"input":"aaaa\na*a*a*a*","output":"true"},{"input":"bbabb\nbb*ab*a*a*b*","output":"true"},{"input":"b\n.","output":"true"},{"input":"bbab\nab.*ba*..","output":"false"},{"input":"babbbab\n.ab*ab","output":"true"},{"input":"aabb\na*aa*b*bb*","output":"true"},{"input":"aabb\na*.*","output":"true"},{"input":"bbbbaaa\n.*ba*","output":"true"},{"input":"babbabbb\n.*.*aab*","output":"false"},{"input":"babbabbaa\n.*aa*b*.*..*","output":"true"},{"input":"babbbb\nbab*b*","output":"true"},{"input":"ab\na*.*","output":"true"},{"input":"aaababbab\na.b*a*ba.*","output":"true"},{"input":"aabaaabbb\n.*a.*a*bb.","output":"true"},{"input":"aaa\naa*","output":"true"},{"input":"\na*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*